+    GEMM (``moe_gemm``) format (``mlp.experts.weight1`` / ``weight2``), where
+    all local experts are fused into a single tensor consumed by fused MoE
+    kernels. Both layouts are supported; the GEMM layout is handled through
+    the GEMM hook contract of the base class.
+    """
+
